flowchart TD
    A["Load facts into working memory"] --> B["Stratum := 0"]
    B --> C["Start a cycle: take a snapshot of the facts"]
    C --> D["Build the conflict set:<br/>every rule instance whose body<br/>matches the snapshot"]
    D --> E{"Any instance with<br/>a new conclusion?"}
    E -->|yes| F["Fire those instances<br/>(refraction skips known facts)"]
    F --> G["Add the new facts, log<br/>rule, bindings, premises"]
    G --> C
    E -->|no| H{"Higher stratum left?"}
    H -->|yes| I["Stratum := stratum + 1<br/>(rules with not)"]
    I --> C
    H -->|no| J["Fixpoint reached:<br/>closure of the KB"]
    J --> K["Check denial constraints IC1-IC7"]
